    "name": "Thursday Crosswalk Community Group",
    "description": "<p>Crosswalk Fellowship is your home away from home! We&rsquo;re a Christian college fellowship within Metro Church, with students living in the Philadelphia area between the ages of 18-22. We gather as a community representing various schools to learn, encourage, challenge, and mature as Christians.</p>\r\n<p>We meet for Community Groups on Wednesdays/Thursdays on Campus. The specific building &amp; room varies, so text &ldquo;Crosswalk&rdquo; to 94000 to connect with us, so we can help you get plugged in! We also meet for Sunday Worship at Metro Church (East Falls), 9:30AM/11:30AM. Rides are provided to both services! Text &ldquo;Crosswalk&rdquo; to 94000 for more information on rides.</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions, you can email andrew@metrophilly.org. Follow our Instagram @CrosswalkFellowship to stay in the loop!</p>",
